# Build output. Vercel runs `node build.js` and serves dist/ — committing it
# would put a generated artifact under review alongside its own source, which
# is exactly the confusion CLAUDE.md's "edit source, not output" rule exists to
# prevent. Delete dist/ and rebuild at any time.
dist/

